"entity": {
"name": "Planet Fitness, Inc.",
"description": "Planet Fitness, Inc. engages in the operation and franchising of fitness centers. It operates through the following segments: Franchise, Corporate-Owned Clubs, and Equipment. The Franchise segment includes operations related to the company's franchising business in the United States, Puerto Rico, Canada, Panama, Mexico, and Australia. The Corporate-Owned Clubs segment consists of operations with respect to all corporate-owned clubs throughout the United States, Canada, and Spain. The Equipment segment involves the sale of equipment to franchisee-owned clubs in the United States, Canada, and Mexico. The company was founded by Michael Grondahl and Marc Grondahl in 1992 and is headquartered in Hampton, NH.",
"rbics_econ": "Consumer Services",
"rbics_sector": "Hospitality Services",
